Try ftp://eecs.nwu.edu/pub/top/top-3.3.tar.gz

Read README, INSTALL, and the FAQ.

Run Configure. I configured as follows:
    sys         decosf1
    sh          [/bin/sh]
    awk         [awk]
    comp        [cc]
    inst        [./install]
    cc options  none
    time        [5.0]
    TOPN def    [24]
    TOPN        [18]
    delay       [5]
    index pw    [yes]
    hash [269]  277
    suid        [4711]
    user        [root]
    group [wheel] root
    bin [/usr/local/bin]  /home/kreymer/top
    manx        [l]
    man [/usr/products/man]
    cat?        [man]

Then 'make install'.

Worked fine for me under OFS1 3.2C .



