>In article <4i1gnf$rld@alterdial.UU.NET>, ian@adone.com (Ian Lintault) writes:
>Hello All,
>
>We are looking at buying the DEC FUSE development enviroment.  Does
>anybody use this enviroment?  I am looking for opinions about the
>current version 2.X and the beta 3.0 versions.
