>In article <4i75hm$rii@david.wheaton.edu>, I wrote:
>>
>>Learning about OSF will give you knowledge that you
>>will be much more likely to use in the business world than VMS.
>>Notice, I'm not saying VMS isn't used in the business world, I'm just
>>saying that Unix is used _much_ more.  I mean, why learn how to use a
