Hi all,

Here is a very interesting (and annoying) problem that I have seen twice so
far.  I created a loadable streams device driver called "natm".  I ran the
following command to load the driver:

sysconfig -v -c natm

The driver did install and everything seemed to be ok.  It loaded without 
any visible errors or problems and I was able to see it in the system list 
